{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","license":{"attribution":"not-required","commercialUse":"allowed","derivatives":"allowed","copyleft":false,"publicDomain":true},"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"7f3935061df17430a3e12f649490c443356f4f9d0aec5a2fabe421079a31aa13","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","completeTranslationApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/complete.json","simpleCompleteTranslationApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/complete.simple.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"启示录","commonName":"启示录","title":"启示录","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"a02cf74f0744f3fcf8d108e04aefa0a9727b5516cb5f88beece32de249c3dd70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/1.json","firstChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"REV","chapter":1},"lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/22.json","lastChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"REV","chapter":22},"totalNumberOfVerses":405},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["妇人和龙"]},{"type":"line_break","paragraph":"p"},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["天上现出大异象来：有一个妇人身披日头，脚踏月亮，头戴十二星的冠冕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["她怀了孕，在生产的艰难中疼痛呼叫。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["天上又现出异象来：有一条大红龙，七头十角；七头上戴着七个冠冕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["它的尾巴拖拉着天上星辰的三分之一，摔在地上。龙就站在那将要生产的妇人面前，等她生产之后，要吞吃她的孩子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["妇人生了一个男孩子，是将来要用铁杖辖管",{"noteId":8},"万国的；她的孩子被提到 神宝座那里去了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["妇人就逃到旷野，在那里有 神给她预备的地方，使她被养活一千二百六十天。"]},{"type":"line_break","paragraph":"p"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["在天上就有了争战。米迦勒同他的使者与龙争战，龙也同它的使者去争战，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["并没有得胜，天上再没有它们的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["大龙就是那古蛇，名叫魔鬼，又叫撒但，是迷惑普天下的。它被摔在地上，它的使者也一同被摔下去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我听见在天上有大声音说：「我 神的救恩、能力、国度，并他基督的权柄，现在都来到了！因为那在我们 神面前昼夜控告我们弟兄的，已经被摔下去了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["弟兄胜过它，是因羔羊的血和自己所见证的道。他们虽至于死，也不爱惜性命。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["所以，诸天和住在其中的，你们都快乐吧！只是地与海有祸了！因为魔鬼知道自己的时候不多，就气忿忿地下到你们那里去了。」"]},{"type":"line_break","paragraph":"p"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["龙见自己被摔在地上，就逼迫那生男孩子的妇人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["于是有大鹰的两个翅膀赐给妇人，叫她能飞到旷野，到自己的地方，躲避那蛇；她在那里被养活一载二载半载。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["蛇就在妇人身后，从口中吐出水来，像河一样，要将妇人冲去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["地却帮助妇人，开口吞了从龙口吐出来的水",{"noteId":9},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["龙向妇人发怒，去与她其余的儿女争战，这儿女就是那守 神诫命、为耶稣作见证的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["那时龙就站在海边的沙上。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"-","text":"辖管：原文是牧","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":5}},{"noteId":9,"caller":"-","text":"原文是河","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/12.json","thisChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"REV","chapter":12},"thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/13.json","nextChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"REV","chapter":13},"nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/11.json","previousChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"REV","chapter":11},"previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"thisChapterAudioTimings":{},"nextChapterAudioTimings":{},"previousChapterAudioTimings":{},"numberOfVerses":18,"simpleChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/12.simple.json"}